  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Caci Technologies obligated $236M in federal contract obligations in FY2026 to date. Caci Technologies won 54 awards in the current fiscal year to date with an average award size of $4.4M. Caci Technologies obligations are down 27.1% year over year. Caci Technologies federal obligations have varied over the last six fiscal years: FY21 $272M, FY22 $236M, FY23 $214M, FY24 $372M, FY25 $324M, and FY26 $236M. Caci Technologies top NAICS market in FY2026 to date is Research and Development in the Physical, Engineering, and Life Sciences (except Nanotechnology and Biotechnology) at $239M. Caci Technologies also appears in additional NAICS listings for FY2026 to date with values shown as negative in the published ranking. Caci Technologies current-year totals are partial, covering fiscal year to date, and the figures reported are contract obligations except where award-value is noted in specific tables.",
